      "content": "look i hear u but i'm really struggling here. i can't get an appointment for a few days and i'm exhausted. if i just take a half dose of the benadryl with my regular dose of hydro, is it actually going to be dangerous? it feels like a lot of worry for something that just makes people drowsy. can i just try it once to see how i feel?",
